          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat p = 800/1000 = 0.8$. Sample size for a proportion: $n = \\left(\\dfrac{z_{\\alpha/2}}{E}\\right)^2 \\hat p(1-\\hat p) = \\left(\\dfrac{1.96}{0.03}\\right)^2 (0.8)(0.2) = 4268.44\\times 0.16 = 682.95$. Round up to the next whole subject: $n = 683$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat p = 800/1000 = 0.8$. Công thức cỡ mẫu cho tỷ lệ: $n = \\left(\\dfrac{z_{\\alpha/2}}{E}\\right)^2 \\hat p(1-\\hat p) = \\left(\\dfrac{1.96}{0.03}\\right)^2 (0.8)(0.2) = 4268.44\\times 0.16 = 682.95$. Làm tròn LÊN: $n = 683$.</p></div>"
