          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat p = 82/110 = 0.74545$. Under $H_0: p_0 = 0.80$, $z_0 = \\dfrac{\\hat p - p_0}{\\sqrt{p_0(1-p_0)/n}} = \\dfrac{0.74545-0.80}{\\sqrt{(0.8)(0.2)/110}} = \\dfrac{-0.05455}{\\sqrt{0.0014545}} = \\dfrac{-0.05455}{0.038138} = -1.43$. Note the denominator uses $p_0$, not $\\hat p$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat p = 82/110 = 0.74545$. Dưới $H_0: p_0 = 0.80$, $z_0 = \\dfrac{\\hat p - p_0}{\\sqrt{p_0(1-p_0)/n}} = \\dfrac{0.74545-0.80}{\\sqrt{(0.8)(0.2)/110}} = \\dfrac{-0.05455}{\\sqrt{0.0014545}} = \\dfrac{-0.05455}{0.038138} = -1.43$. Lưu ý mẫu số dùng $p_0$ chứ không dùng $\\hat p$.</p></div>"
